** {p:Proto-Waypoint} would be the fastest way to get there.
** {p:Survival Guide} (Norvallen/Davoi) is also a fast option if you don't have the {p:Proto-Waypoint}
* Head to {z:Monastic Cavern} from the (H-11) entrance in Davoi.
* Touch the __Ritual Site__ at the border of (H-10)/(H-9) inside the Monastic Cavern to begin a confrontation with an Orcish Bewitcher (BLM/DRK).
** Has about 30k HP.
** Uses {p:Manafont} as early as 90% HP.
** You will automatically receive the {@k} {k:Orcish battle plan} upon defeating the NM.
* Return to Quemaricond for a cutscene to receive {@k} {k:Quemaricond's report}.
** {s:Escape} then re-enter {z:Davoi} is the fastest path.
* Speak with Rahal for the final cutscene and your reward.

